    "A workflow's stages never notify you. Needs you also follows Questions and approvals; the others follow Chat replies. Needs bighelp plugin 3.7.0 or later.": {
      "comment": "Simplified Chinese draft for Simple Bot mode, Teamwork and their Settings pages (#527); fluent-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A workflow's stages never notify you. Needs you also follows Questions and approvals; the others follow Chat replies. Needs bighelp plugin 3.7.0 or later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "工作流的各个阶段不会通知你。“需要你处理”也遵循“问题和审批”的设置，其他各项遵循“聊天回复”的设置。需要 bighelp 插件 3.7.0 或更高版本。"
