    "Auto keeps the large avatar on the biggest iPhones and uses Medium on the rest. With the name hidden, tap the avatar for the agent's profile, or touch and hold it to switch agents.": {
      "comment": "Simplified Chinese draft for Simple Bot mode, Teamwork and their Settings pages (#527); fluent-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto keeps the large avatar on the biggest iPhones and uses Medium on the rest. With the name hidden, tap the avatar for the agent's profile, or touch and hold it to switch agents."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "选择“自动”时，最大尺寸的 iPhone 使用大头像，其他机型使用中等头像。隐藏名字时，轻点头像可查看智能体资料，按住头像可切换智能体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
